data: {"id": "2c30fd0d42b1497f-final", "run_id": "2c30fd0d42b1497f", "seq": 2073, "ts_ms": 1788408090471, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh 处于 Pending 状态，节点为 <none>，持续 71 分钟未调度 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning FailedScheduling ... 0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.` | 核心异常信号，明确调度失败的直接原因是节点亲和性/选择器不匹配 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `PodScheduled` 条件状态 `False`，Reason: `Unschedulable` | 确认 Pod 处于持续的未调度状态 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | 容器资源请求：CPU `5m`, Memory `8Mi`；限制：CPU `50m`, Memory `32Mi` | 资源请求极低，排除资源配额不足导致的调度失败 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase` (Pending): `1` | 确认 Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态，无其他状态波动 |\n\n**证据印证：**\nKubernetes 事件与状态均一致指向 `Unschedulable` 阶段。事件原文 `3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector` 结合极低且合理的资源配置（证据 3），证明该异常纯粹由调度约束（选择器/亲和性）与集群实际节点拓扑不匹配导致，而非容量或资源竞争问题。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 调度约束配置为 nodeSelector: {aiops.lab/unavailable: true} → 集群所有 3 个节点均未匹配该节点选择器/亲和性要求 → 调度器触发 FailedScheduling 事件，PodScheduled 条件为 False → Pod 停留在 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：** Pod 配置了节点选择器 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true`，但集群中所有可用节点均不包含该标签，导致调度器无法找到匹配节点（NodeSelector 不匹配）。\n\n**证据支撑：**\n- **直接现象**：K8s Event 报告 `3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector`（证据 1），确认集群节点无法满足 Pod 的亲和性约束。\n- **状态确认**：Pod 状态 `Pending`（证据 2、4），且持续时间长达 71 分钟，证明该约束问题持续存在。\n- **排除资源瓶颈**：容器的资源请求（证据 3）极低，表明集群拥有足够的调度能力，问题仅限于拓扑约束匹配。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 22.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 43.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh: 43.8s (Evidence 35.1s, RCA 8.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 74.474, "metrics": {"run_id": "2c30fd0d42b1497f", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 74.48129487037659, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 74481.29487037659, "llm_calls": 12, "llm_duration_ms": 69845.04985809326, "tool_calls": 10, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 10920.188426971436, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4264.231443405151}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 22469.968795776367, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 43760.10179